<title>NETHERLANDS: OPG 1996/97 FIRST HALF NET FALLS 11 PCT.</title>
<headline>OPG 1996/97 FIRST HALF NET FALLS 11 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.16 vs   2.40</p>
<p>    Net profit			    30.3  vs  34.0</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (guilders)	0.80 vs   same</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   1.23 vs   1.31</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    45.2  vs  54.3</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     2.5  vs   3.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Pharmaceuticals wholesaler Apothekers Combinatie OPG</p>
<p>UA previously said it expected profits to fall in 1996/97.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
